# claude-mem per-directory memory — internal only. Never let these become Astro
# routes (any CLAUDE.md under src/pages/ would be served as a page + sitemapped).
src/pages/**/CLAUDE.md

# Artefactos locales de saastro-relay: `knowledge/` se REGENERA en cada sync
# (INDEX.md lleva un `last_sync` que cambia solo) y ensuciaba todos los commits.
# Mismo criterio que hub, platform y forms.
.saastro-relay
knowledge/
